　「十七版汉字寻界」
　　于『4E00..9FFF;FA0E..FA0F;FA11..FA11;FA13..FA14;FA1F..FA1F;FA21..FA21;FA23..FA24;FA27..FA29;3400..4DBF;20000..2A6DF;2A700..2B81D;2B820..2CEAD;2CEB0..2EBE0;2EBF0..2EE5D;30000..3134A;31350..33479;』
